  "question": "If $A = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 5 \\end{bmatrix}$ then the value of $|A^{2009} - 5A^{2008}|$ is:",
  "answeroption": "B",
  "explanation": "Let $B = A^{2009} - 5A^{2008}$<br /><br />$B = A^{2008}(A - 5I)$<br /><br />$A - 5I = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 5 \\end{bmatrix} - \\begin{bmatrix} 5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 \\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix} -4 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}$<br /><br />$|A - 5I| = (-4)(0) - (2)(3) = -6$<br /><br />Using determinant properties: $|B| = |A^{2008}| \\cdot |A - 5I|$<br /><br />$|A^{2008}| = (|A|)^{2008}$<br /><br />$|A| = (1)(5) - (2)(3) = 5 - 6 = -1$<br /><br />$|B| = (-1)^{2008} \\cdot (-6) = 1 \\cdot (-6) = -6$",
  "explanation_image": [],
